{"findings": [{"file": "pkg/api/webassets/webassets.go", "line": 48, "severity": "low", "category": "perf", "title": "Cache not re-checked after taking the write lock", "body": "`GetWebAssets` checks the cache under `RLock`, releases it, then takes the exclusive `Lock`. Once it holds the exclusive lock it never checks again whether another goroutine has already filled `entryPointAssetsCache`.

